# ---- Audio ----
# NOTE: Audio/ is NOT ignored - the game loads these at runtime, e.g.
#   new Audio("Audio/RedsTurn.wav"), "Audio/Nbr" + seconds + ".wav"
# Removing them would break the game for anyone who clones the repo.
# Only spare/unused audio stashes are ignored below.
**/New folder/
**/New folder (*)/
timless-classicsA/

# ---- Media folders ----
Video/

# ---- Archives ----
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.gz
*.iso

